/**
 * Seconds cap for native folder zpaq {@code x} extract. {@code FRACTAL_ZIP_ZPAQ_EXTRACT_TIMEOUT_SEC} overrides;
 * else falls back to {@code FRACTAL_ZIP_ZPAQ_TIMEOUT_SEC}. 0 = no timeout wrapper.
